{
  "description": [
    "ctadl query model for the TaintBench `beita_com_beita_contact` app. Sources and",
    "sinks are derived from the framework methods named in the source/sink IR (Jimple)",
    "signatures of beita_com_beita_contact_findings.json: ContentResolver.query() returns",
    "contact data (source); FileInputStream.<init>(String) opens the file holding leaked",
    "contact data (source); Transport.sendMessage / BufferedWriter.write /",
    "DataOutputStream.write exfiltrate it (sinks). Sinks use Argument(*) so any tainted",
    "argument reaching the call counts as a leak. ctadl ignores the non-schema keys",
    "(`description`) in this file, as it does `expected_lines` in the nightly models."
  ],
  "model_generators": [
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "query",
          "parent": "Landroid/content/ContentResolver;"
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "sources": [
          {
            "kind": "ContactData",
            "port": "Return"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "<init>",
          "parent": "Ljava/io/FileInputStream;"
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "sources": [
          {
            "kind": "FileData",
            "port": "Argument(0)"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "sendMessage",
          "parent": "Ljavax/mail/Transport;"
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "sinks": [
          {
            "kind": "Exfiltration",
            "port": "Argument(*)"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "write",
          "parent": "Ljava/io/BufferedWriter;"
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "sinks": [
          {
            "kind": "Exfiltration",
            "port": "Argument(*)"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "write",
          "parent": "Ljava/io/DataOutputStream;"
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "sinks": [
          {
            "kind": "Exfiltration",
            "port": "Argument(*)"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
